      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e It is because calling `early_init_fdt_scan_reserved_mem` results with saving fdt node into `reserved_mem[]` array with pointer to name from the original `inital_dtb`, which is later on discarded due to `__initdata` stamping.\n\nWhy is it not causing a problem on arm64? `__fdt_pointer` is `__initdata` too?",
      "parentUuid": "494b7354_59b5bf95",
      "revId": "7eb1c90f776cec249f0a938310de751e3cbdbc8f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
